{"t_ms": 299390, "conversation_id": "v2llm_streaming_retrieve_s010", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Late Check-out Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nLate check-out is available upon request and depends on room availability. Guests checking out between 11:00 AM and 2:00 PM may be charged a partial room rate. Check-outs after 2:00 PM are generally charged as a full night's stay. Guests are advised to contact the Front Desk at least one day in advance to request a late check-out.", "Check-in Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nStandard check-in time is 2:00 PM. Guests are required to present a valid government-issued photo ID and the booking confirmation at the reception. A refundable security deposit may be collected during check-in, depending on the room category. Early check-in is subject to room availability and hotel policies. Guests arriving before the standard check-in time may request luggage storage free of charge while waiting for their room.\n", "Visitor Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nVisitors are permitted between 8:00 AM and 10:00 PM after registering at the Front Desk with a valid photo ID. Overnight visitors are not allowed unless officially added to the room reservation and applicable charges have been settled. Hotel management reserves the right to deny entry if security concerns arise."], "scores": [0.5304158329963684, 0.5489981770515442, 0.557630181312561], "filenames": ["04_late_checkout.txt", "01_checkin_policy.txt", "56_visitor_policy.txt"], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 84, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
